.TH FOREST-LOGOUT 1 "July 2026" "forest" "Forest desktop environment"
.SH NAME
forest-logout \- Forest power/session actions dialog
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B forest-logout
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B forest-logout
is a standalone, fullscreen dialog offering power and session actions
such as log out, restart, and shut down. It is styled using the active
Forest theme's
.I logout.css
and is typically launched from the Forest panel's power menu.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR forest (1)
